From the AMD ROCm release build
-------------------------------

Built in AMD's ROCm release CI; build paths under /__w/rockrel/rockrel remain
in the binaries.

libhsa-runtime64.so.1           ROCR-Runtime 1.21.0
librocm_sysdeps_elf.so.1        elfutils (libelf), version unknown
librocm_sysdeps_numa.so.1       numactl (libnuma), version unknown
librocm_sysdeps_drm.so.2        libdrm, version unknown
librocm_sysdeps_drm_amdgpu.so.1 libdrm_amdgpu, version unknown
librocm_sysdeps_z.so.1          zlib 1.3.2
librocm_sysdeps_zstd.so.1       Zstandard 1.5.7
librocm_sysdeps_liblzma.so.5    XZ Utils (liblzma) 5.8.1
librocm_sysdeps_bz2.so          bzip2 (libbzip2) 1.0.8

The librocm_sysdeps_* libraries are AMD repackagings, with renamed SONAMEs and
versioned symbols (AMDROCM_SYSDEPS_1.0_*), of the upstream projects named above.


From the build host -- NOT part of the AMD build
------------------------------------------------

These four binaries are Arch Linux distribution packages that were swept in
from the machine that assembled the bundle. Each is byte-identical, by GNU
build-id, to the host system copy. They are not artifacts of the AMD ROCm build
that produced libhsa-runtime64.so.1 and should be replaced by the matching AMD
build before this bundle is redistributed.

librocprofiler-register.so.0    rocprofiler-register 0.6.0 (ROCm 7.2.4)
libfmt.so.12                    fmt 12.2.0
libglog.so.2                    glog 0.7.1
libgflags.so.2.2                gflags 2.2.2

libfmt and libglog are required only by librocprofiler-register.so.0, and
libgflags only by libglog. Sourcing rocprofiler-register from the AMD build may
remove all four from the bundle.


